                 {
                     "name":  "Get User Gyms",
                     "request":  {
                                     "description":  "Fetches the current user's gyms (workspaces) with pagination and a status filter.\n\n### Query Parameters\n\n| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `pageNumber` | `int` | No | Page number (default `1`) |\n| `pageSize` | `int` | No | Page size (default `10`, max `50`) |\n| `orderBy` | `string` | No | Sort field (default `Id`) |\n| `orderDirection` | `string` | No | `asc` or `desc` |\n| `isActive` | `bool` | No | Filter by active status |\n| `searchTerm` | `string?` | No | Free-text search |\n| `statusFilter` | `string?` | No | Gym status: `Active`, `Expired`, `Locked`, `Blocked` |\n\n### Response\n\nReturns `UserGymsListRDTO` with `gyms`, `hasActivePlatformSubscription`, `totalCount`, `pageNumber`, and `pageSize`. Each gym contains `gymId`, `gymName`, `logoUrl`, `role`, `gymStatus`, `isAccessible`, and `inaccessibleReason`.",
                                     "method":  "GET",
                                     "header":  [

                                                ],
                                     "url":  {
                                                 "raw":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/Gym/user-gyms?pageNumber=1\u0026pageSize=10\u0026orderBy=Id\u0026orderDirection=asc\u0026isActive=true",
                                                 "host":  [
                                                              "{{baseUrl}}"
                                                          ],
                                                 "path":  [
                                                              "api",
                                                              "Gym",
                                                              "user-gyms"
                                                          ],
                                                 "query":  [
                                                               {
                                                                   "key":  "pageNumber",
                                                                   "value":  "1"
                                                               },
                                                               {
                                                                   "key":  "pageSize",
                                                                   "value":  "10"
                                                               },
                                                               {
                                                                   "key":  "orderBy",
                                                                   "value":  "Id"
                                                               },
                                                               {
                                                                   "key":  "orderDirection",
                                                                   "value":  "asc"
                                                               },
                                                               {
                                                                   "key":  "isActive",
                                                                   "value":  "true"
                                                               },
                                                               {
                                                                   "key":  "searchTerm",
                                                                   "value":  ""
                                                               },
                                                               {
                                                                   "key":  "statusFilter",
                                                                   "value":  "Active"
                                                               }
                                                           ]
                                             }
                                 },
                     "response":  [

                                  ]
